<title>RUSSIA: Russian PPI slows to 0.5 pct monthly in May.</title>
<headline>Russian PPI slows to 0.5 pct monthly in May.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian monthly industrial prices rose 0.5 percent in May after growing 0.8 percent in April, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL PRICES  MAY 97    APR 97    MAY 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    +0.5	+0.8	+1.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +17.5     +18.2     +57.0</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
